---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import Cta from '../components/Cta.astro';
---
<Base
  title="About — psiberAI"
  description="psiberAI is an independent security and AI advisory for regulated enterprises — vendor-neutral, standards-led, focused on evidence over assertion."
>
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="About"
    title="Independent security & AI advisory."
    lead="psiberAI helps regulated enterprises get ahead of the quantum threat and stay audit-ready across information security and AI governance — with work that produces evidence, not just opinions."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>What we believe</h2>
      <p>
        Security should be <strong>provable</strong>. Too much of the industry sells reassurance;
        we sell evidence — an inventory you can check, a risk map you can defend, a roadmap you can
        execute. If a claim can't be shown, it isn't worth making to your board.
      </p>
      <p>
        We're <strong>vendor-neutral by design</strong>. We don't resell products or take referral
        fees, so our assessments answer one question only: what's genuinely best for you. That
        independence is the whole value of an outside opinion — the moment it's compromised, so is the
        advice.
      </p>

      <h2>What we focus on</h2>
      <p>
        Our lead practice is <a href="/services/pqc-migration">post-quantum cryptography migration</a> —
        helping organizations find their cryptographic exposure and plan the multi-year transition to
        the NIST-standardized algorithms before "harvest-now, decrypt-later" becomes a breach. Around
        it we do the compliance work that regulated enterprises need:
        <a href="/services/iso-27001">ISO 27001</a> for information security and
        <a href="/services/iso-42001">ISO 42001</a> for AI governance. The lines reinforce each other —
        the same rigor, and often the same evidence, serves all three.
      </p>

      <h2>Who we work with</h2>
      <p>
        Regulated and data-sensitive organizations — finance, healthcare, technology, critical
        infrastructure — across the US, Europe, the UAE and Australia. If your data has to stay
        confidential for years, or you answer to auditors and regulators, we're built for you.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Cta />
</Base>
